				<h2 class="left-section-title">Core Skills</h2>
				<ul class="skills-list">
					<li><strong>Programming:</strong> C++, C#, Python</li>
					<li><strong>Graphics & Shaders:</strong> HLSL, GLSL, Compute Shaders, VFX Graph</li>
					<li><strong>Engines & Tools:</strong> Unity (Expert), Unreal Engine 5, Custom OpenGL Frameworks, Blender</li>
					<li><strong>Workflows:</strong> Git, Jira, Project Management, Agile Product Strategy</li>
				</ul>

				<h2 class="left-section-title">Education</h2>
				<div class="left-item">
					<h3 class="left-item-title">M.Sc. Cinema and Media Engineering</h3>
					<div class="left-item-subtitle">Politecnico di Torino | 2024 - 2026</div>
					<p class="left-item-desc">Expected mark: 110/110 Cum Laude (Dec 2026).</p>
				</div>
				<div class="left-item">
					<h3 class="left-item-title">B.Sc. Cinema and Media Engineering</h3>
					<div class="left-item-subtitle">Politecnico di Torino | 2021 - 2024</div>
