						<span class="experience-location">Torino / Firenze, Italy</span>
					</div>
					<ul class="experience-desc">
						<li>Engineered <strong>PulseEngine</strong>, a real-time bio-adaptive telemetry and volumetric CSG framework in Unity 6 for standalone Medical XR (Meta Quest 3).</li>
